<title>USA: Taitron to buy back up to 200,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Taitron to buy back up to 200,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taitron Components Inc Tuesday said its board of directors has authorized the company to repurchase up to 200,000 shares of its common stock from time to time in open-market transactions.</p>
<p>Taitron has approximately 6.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
